Summary of changes for The Rehearsal
- Adapted the multi-agent simulation framework into a two-phase leadership
  rehearsal workflow covering pre-rollout stakeholder network mapping,
  consensus pathway calculation, six-axis plan evaluation and round-by-round
  stakeholder simulation across three organizational tiers.
- Added leadership planner, evaluator, cross-session memory, terrain runner
  and stakeholder persona agents alongside post-simulation diagnostic cards
  for executive coaching, 90-day action planning, translation diagnostics
  and compliance with the knowledge withheld checks.

